[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2423398660","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98320#issuecomment-2423398660","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98320","id":2423398660,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6QciEE","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-19T00:18:31Z","updated_at":"2024-10-19T00:18:31Z","body":"The function does return the `AtlasTexture` with the region from which the frame is from, but the region won't be automatically used when assigned to the `StandardMaterial`. Here's something that probably works:\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\n@onready var mesh_instance_3d: MeshInstance3D = $MeshInstance3D\r\n@export var sprites: SpriteFrames\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar material: StandardMaterial3D = mesh_instance_3d.mesh.surface_get_material(0)\r\n\tvar atlas_texture: AtlasTexture = sprites.get_frame_texture(\"default\", 2)\r\n\tvar atlas_size: Vector2 = atlas_texture.atlas.get_size()\r\n\tvar atlas_region: Rect2 = atlas_texture.region\r\n\tvar uv_offset: Vector2 = atlas_region.position / atlas_size\r\n\tvar uv_scale: Vector2 = atlas_region.size / atlas_size\r\n\tmaterial.uv1_offset = Vector3(uv_offset.x, uv_offset.y, 0.0)\r\n\tmaterial.uv1_scale = Vector3(uv_scale.x, uv_scale.y, 0.0)\r\n\tmaterial.albedo_texture = atlas_texture\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2423398660/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2423680914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98320#issuecomment-2423680914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98320","id":2423680914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Qdm-S","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-19T08:12:20Z","updated_at":"2024-10-19T08:12:20Z","body":"Related:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot